   "ocr_text": "1998-04-18  2101.5\nAnnual inspection.\n1. Performed annual inspection IAW FAR 43 App. D. 2. Replaced left main tire. 3. Lubricated all controls. Aircraft returned to service.\nR. Mitchell  A&P 2214467 IA",
