   "review_status": "confirmed",
   "extraction_status": "extracted",
   "ocr_text": "2011-08-22  3384.0\nAnnual inspection. AD compliance.\n1. Annual inspection IAW FAR 43 App. D. 2. Complied with AD 2011-10-09 seat rail inspection \u2014 no wear beyond limits, next due in 100 hrs. 3. Replaced ELT battery.\nD. Alvarez  A&P 3105582 IA",
