   "review_status": "confirmed",
   "extraction_status": "extracted",
   "ocr_text": "2019-03-12  3891.2\nAvionics upgrade \u2014 see avionics log.\nRemoved King KX-155 NAV/COM. Installed Garmin GTN 650 GPS/NAV/COM per STC SA01714WI. Weight & balance amended, new equipment list issued. Form 337 filed.\nSkyTech Avionics  CRS #ST4R881K",
