   "page_sequence": 6,
   "review_status": "unreviewed",
   "extraction_status": "extracted",
   "ocr_text": "2026-03-02  4205.8\nReplaced landing light.\nReplaced burned out landing light lamp (GE 4509) in L/H wing. Ops check good.\nM. Torres  A&P 3667012\n\n2026-07-18  4219.6\nAnnual inspection.\n1. Annual inspection IAW FAR 43 App. D. 2. Complied with AD 2011-10-09 seat rails, no wear beyond limits. 3. ELT inspected IAW 91.207, battery exp 02/2027. 4. Replaced nose strut seals. Aircraft found airworthy and returned to service.\nD. Alvarez  A&P 3105582 IA",
   "unread_rotated_content": false,
   "updated_at": "2026-11-19T00:25:16.011695+00:00",
