   "ocr_text": "2005-09-14  2803.0\nEngine overhaul.\nLycoming O-320-H2AD overhauled to service limits by Signal Engines. Zero time SMOH. New Slick magnetos, harness, and plugs installed. Test run normal.\nSignal Engines Inc.  CRS #SE9K204M",
