   "ocr_text": "2024-11-02  4131.5\nOil change.\nDrained oil, replaced filter (CH48110-1), serviced with 7 qts Phillips XC 20W-50 + CamGuard. Cut filter \u2014 no metal. Compressions 76/74/75/77 over 80.\nM. Torres  A&P 3667012\n\n2025-06-08  4172.1\nOil change.\nDrained oil, new filter, 7 qts Phillips XC 20W-50. Oil sample sent to Blackstone \u2014 results normal. No leaks noted.\nM. Torres  A&P 3667012",
