   "ocr_text": "2025-10-11  4196.4\nOil change.\nDrained oil, new filter CH48110-1, 7 qts Phillips XC 20W-50 + CamGuard. Cut filter, no metal.\nM. Torres  A&P 3667012\n\n2026-07-18  4219.6\nAnnual inspection, engine.\nInspected engine IAW FAR 43 App. D. Compressions 75/73/76/76 over 80. Cleaned, gapped and rotated plugs. Mags timed 25 BTC. No leaks.\nD. Alvarez  A&P 3105582 IA",
