   "ocr_text": "2019-03-12  3891.2\nGTN 650 installation.\nInstalled Garmin GTN 650 per STC SA01714WI: new tray, antenna (GA 35), wiring. Interfaced to existing GI 106A CDI. Ground and flight checked \u2014 normal.\nSkyTech Avionics  CRS #ST4R881K\n\n2023-02-11  4038.9\nELT battery replacement.\nReplaced ELT battery (ACK E-04). New expiration: Feb 2027. Self-test normal, remote switch checked.\nM. Torres  A&P 3667012",
